Way to Find a Function Module Exit:

1. Put a Break-point on the statement CALL CUSTOMER-FUNCTION.
2. Put the package name in SMOD transaction code (Utilities - find - package name )
3. Go to transaction code - SE84(enhancement - Customber exit) 

===================================================================================================================

Step to Implement a Function Module Exit:

1. Go to the transaction - CMOD. 
2. Provide a project name and click create
3. Click on enhancemet assignment tab and provide the customer exist name. 
4. Click on components tab - it shows the variable function module exits available.
5. Double click on required function exit which navigate to function module. 
6. Write the logic in the Z include of that function module. 
7. Activate the project.
